# Agent scratch evidence: patches, dumps, logs, screenshots an agent produced to
# prove a change worked. None of it is repo state. Matched as /.amp/* rather than
# /.amp/ so a future negation can opt a real config file back in; git cannot
# unignore anything inside an ignored directory.
/.amp/*

